gaggiuino-local-profiler/node_modules/
gaggiuino-local-profiler/public/
gaggiuino-local-profiler/coverage/
gaggiuino-local-profiler/go/**/*_templ.go

# Phase 1 (#901): the SPA bundle internal/webapp embeds is a build artifact,
# produced by `make -C go frontend` or the Dockerfile's builder stage via
# cmd/frontend-build (esbuild's Go API, #1033). Only the committed
# dist/index.html placeholder is tracked, so a bare `go build ./...` resolves
# the embed with no frontend build step.
gaggiuino-local-profiler/go/internal/webapp/dist/*
!gaggiuino-local-profiler/go/internal/webapp/dist/index.html

# local runtime/verification artifacts — never committed, may contain live tokens
**/data_verify_tmp/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
api_token.txt
preheat_state.json

# defence-in-depth: secrets that must never land in git regardless of location
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa
id_rsa.*

.memsearch/
# No trailing slash: graphify-out exists as a symlink in some checkouts, and
# a `graphify-out/` pattern only matches real directories — which is how the
# symlink kept getting re-added to the index despite being "ignored" (#1033).
graphify-out
.claude/settings.local.json
**/.claude/skills/
**/.agents/
**/skills-lock.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
